(BSD-3-Clause WITH PCRE2-exception, and SLJIT under BSD-2-Clause). Their license
texts are in Contents/Resources/licenses/sshfs.
Their complete corresponding source, patches, build recipes and static relink
materials are in the cage-macos-guest-VERSION-source.tar.gz release asset,
also retained in Contents/Resources/guest-os/sources inside the macOS App.
